cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ns3-ntn-toolkit: a pre-integrated ns-3 simulation platform for 6G non-terrestrial networks"
abstract: >-
  A fork of ns-3.43 carrying fourteen custom modules for 6G non-terrestrial
  network research: LEO satellite constellation generation and contact-graph
  routing, 3GPP NR-NTN protocol stacks with conditional handover and SIB19
  timing, satellite O-RAN with E2 and A1 control loops, sub-terahertz and
  terahertz link modeling, GPU ray tracing through Sionna RT, space-air-ground
  integrated networking, network slicing, satellite-assisted V2X, a network
  digital twin, and Gymnasium environments for reinforcement learning. The
  decision plane and the measurement plane are the same plane: a handover a
  trigger fires moves a terminal onto a cell whose SINR is then measured.
type: software
